io.github.rylxes:signoz-spring-boot2-starter 1.0.9 发布, Add this single dependency to a Spring Boot 2.x project to enable all SigNoz features:
        @SigNozLog (compile-time logger injection), @Masked (field masking), @Traced (OTel spans),
        @AuditLog (audit trail), HTTP request logging, and Micrometer OTLP metrics.

